OL,3,GNEWSAFive inflatable monsters taken
OL,4,Adown due to wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive inflatable monsters on rooftops
OL,7,Facross Leicester city centre for a
OL,8,FHalloween trail have been taken down
OL,9,Ftemporarily due to windy weather.
OL,11,FBID Leicester confirmed five of the
OL,12,Feight monsters - which were all on
OL,13,Fdisplay on Wednesday - would be taking
OL,14,Fshelter over the weekend.
OL,16,FThe Met Office issued a yellow weather
OL,17,Fwarning for wind covering large
OL,18,Fsections of England, including
OL,19,FLeicester, on Friday, with gusts also
OL,20,Fforecast to reach more than 40mph
OL,21,F(64.4km/h) on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
