OL,3,GNEWSAFive inflatable monsters taken
OL,4,Adown due to wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for BID Leicester said:
OL,7,F"We're really sorry for the disruption,
OL,8,Fespecially during our opening weekend
OL,9,Fand half-term, but keeping everyone
OL,10,Fsafe has to come first."
